Split and repeater help

l) Turn off if on, or start setup if off.

In FM, YAC uses a saved offset if available. If prompted, enter the offset in hertz. Type - for Minus or + for Plus.
In other modes, enter the transmit frequency in MHz.
Enter) Apply the value.
Blank Enter) Cancel setup.
q) Return to Top Level and keep the current setting.

